      "entries": [
        "60 feet. The rompo hums in a low voice. Each creature within the emanation must succeed at a DC 19 Will save or become fascinated and compelled to move away from the rompo, traveling to the furthest edge of the emanation. Fascinated creatures are also flat-footed. The effect lasts for 1 round, but if the rompo spends a single action on subsequent rounds, it can extend the duration by 1 round for all affected creatures. If the rompo attacks, the fascinated condition ends only for the creature that is attacked. On a successful save, a creature is temporarily immune to Crooning Cry for 24 hours."
